+# Solution
+
+Implemented `redact` with a compiled, case-insensitive regular expression matching the documented API-key prefixes, a minimum of 12 alphanumeric key characters, and word boundaries. The input is processed line by line with line endings preserved so that lines whose first token starts with `DEBUG_` can pass through unchanged; all other lines have every matching key replaced with `***`.
+
+The full test suite passes. The README has a notable tension: it calls masking unconditional across the entire input, then explicitly exempts `DEBUG_` logger lines. The implementation treats the later, more specific operational exception as controlling.
diff --git a/redactor/redactor.py b/redactor/redactor.py
